— Parses an HTML document from a string</li><li>{@link Dom\HTMLDocument::saveHtml} — Serializes the document as an HTML string</li><li>{@link Dom\HTMLDocument::saveHtmlFile} — Serializes the document as an HTML file</li><li>{@link Dom\HTMLDocument::saveXml} — Serializes the document as an XML string</li><li>{@link Dom\HTMLDocument::saveXmlFile} — Serializes the document as an XML file</li></ul></div>
