php#constant.false">false</a></span></strong> on failure.  </p> </div> <div class="refsect1 errors" id="refsect1-dom-htmldocument.savehtmlfile-errors">  <h3 class="title">错误／异常</h3>  <ul class="itemizedlist">   <li class="listitem">    <span class="simpara">     Throws a <span class="exceptionname"><a href="https://php.net/manual/zh/class.valueerror.php" class="exceptionname">ValueError</a></span> if     <span class="parameter" style="color:#3A95FF">filename</span> is an empty string or contains any     null bytes.    </span>   </li>  </ul> </div> <div class="refsect1 seealso" id="refsect1-dom-htmldocument.savehtmlfile-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Dom\HTMLDocument::saveHtml()} - Serializes the document as an HTML string</span></li>   <li><span class="methodname" style="color:#CC7832">{@link Dom\HTMLDocument::saveXmlFile()} - Serializes the document as an XML file</span></li>  </ul> </div></div>
 */
    public function saveHtmlFile(string $filename): int|false {}


